Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:05.46,Narration,,0,0,0,,Across Afghanistan, talented students —\Nespecially women and girls facing closed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:10.62,Narration,,0,0,0,,doors — must navigate foreign scholarship\Nsystems in a second or third language.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.67,0:00:13.36,Narration,,0,0,0,,Requirements get lost in translation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.41,0:00:18.85,Narration,,0,0,0,,BursYar turns a scholarship page into a\Npersonal, evidence-based action plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:22.42,Narration,,0,0,0,,This is BursYar, running live.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.47,0:00:28.70,Narration,,0,0,0,,A guided workspace takes you from\Npossibility to a plan — discover, review, assess, act.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:30.33,Narration,,0,0,0,,Start with discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:35.59,Narration,,0,0,0,,The research library searches and filters\Nhistorical leads — every record honestly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.59,0:00:37.84,Narration,,0,0,0,,labeled as needing re-verification.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:43.25,Narration,,0,0,0,,Then, read the official source — never a\Nrumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.30,0:00:46.19,Narration,,0,0,0,,Signed-out visitors meet a clear sign-in\Ngate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.24,0:00:48.18,Narration,,0,0,0,,Nothing is fetched silently.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.23,0:00:53.59,Narration,,0,0,0,,With approval, BursYar fetches the official\Npage and shows exactly what it retrieved —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.59,0:00:55.36,Narration,,0,0,0,,before anything is analyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.41,0:00:57.27,Narration,,0,0,0,,Documents stay private.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:01:02.72,Narration,,0,0,0,,You consent, review each extracted claim,\Nreject what is wrong — a rejected degree
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.72,0:01:04.46,Narration,,0,0,0,,never enters your profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.30,0:01:14.74,Narration,,0,0,0,,This screen shows the analysis interface\Nwith a simulated response.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.79,0:01:16.20,Narration,,0,0,0,,AI interprets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.25,0:01:17.71,Narration,,0,0,0,,Evidence decides.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:23.28,Narration,,0,0,0,,Meta Muse Spark 1.3 reads the approved text\Nand selects candidate evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:28.99,Narration,,0,0,0,,Two live runs are on record — four criteria\Nand two funding excerpts validated locally,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.99,0:01:31.42,Narration,,0,0,0,,one and one on hosted infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.47,0:01:36.94,Narration,,0,0,0,,But the model is never trusted blindly:\Nevery quotation is re-checked against the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.94,0:01:38.44,Narration,,0,0,0,,source, byte for byte.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.30,0:01:43.96,Narration,,0,0,0,,Every machine claim stays bound to its\Nquotation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.01,0:01:44.68,Narration,,0,0,0,,Met.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.73,0:01:45.62,Narration,,0,0,0,,Not met.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.67,0:01:47.23,Narration,,0,0,0,,Or honestly unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:52.22,Narration,,0,0,0,,The conservative compiler compares your\Nreviewed profile against the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.27,0:01:57.25,Narration,,0,0,0,,What it cannot prove, it calls unknown — and\Nunknown is never treated as eligible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:02:03.16,Narration,,0,0,0,,When evidence is missing, PathFinder names\Nthe gap and shows the legitimate next step:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.16,0:02:06.53,Narration,,0,0,0,,verify the exact requirement with the\Ninstitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.30,0:02:11.48,Narration,,0,0,0,,Reviewed by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.53,0:02:13.20,Narration,,0,0,0,,Never verified for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.25,0:02:18.34,Narration,,0,0,0,,Every claim carries its exact source\Nquotation — with an explicit warning until a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:19.74,Narration,,0,0,0,,human has reviewed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.79,0:02:21.25,Narration,,0,0,0,,In your own language.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:25.48,Narration,,0,0,0,,English, Dari, and Pashto — with full\Nright-to-left support.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.53,0:02:29.51,Narration,,0,0,0,,Translations are machine-drafted and still\Nawait human review.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:42.55,Narration,,0,0,0,,BursYar: evidence-first AI, conservative\Neligibility, actionable guidance, private by design.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.60,0:02:47.93,Narration,,0,0,0,,Built for the students who need clarity most\N— so they can understand what a scholarship
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.93,0:02:51.98,Narration,,0,0,0,,demands, gather the right proof, and take\Nthe next step themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.03,0:02:54.23,Narration,,0,0,0,,From possibility to a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.28,0:02:55.20,Narration,,0,0,0,,BursYar.
